{"slug": "garden-wise-pt-1-a539eda3", "synopsis": "*Garden Wise (Pt 1)* is an instructional film about improving lawns and gardens through soil preparation, fertilization, and chemical treatments. It explains how shrinking soil can crack, lose water, and become caked, while cultivation alters its structure. Alongside scenes of novice gardeners planting, the film presents Monsanto\u2019s Krilium soil conditioner and related gardening practices.", "clips": [{"id": "62092bf6-ab8b-5301-ae4b-7e8dd9186386", "sourceSlug": "garden-wise-pt-1-a539eda3", "sourceTitle": "Garden Wise (Pt 1)", "sourceYear": null, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 47.08, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/a539eda3-a47b-5b08-a2d6-a2bcead0bd58/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/62092bf6-ab8b-5301-ae4b-7e8dd9186386.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/a539eda3-a47b-5b08-a2d6-a2bcead0bd58/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/62092bf6-ab8b-5301-ae4b-7e8dd9186386.jpg"}, {"id": "254a4c63-79d7-55c3-86f3-20c38c90beef", "sourceSlug": "garden-wise-pt-1-a539eda3", "sourceTitle": "Garden Wise (Pt 1)", "sourceYear": null, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 47.08, "endSeconds": 51.218, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/a539eda3-a47b-5b08-a2d6-a2bcead0bd58/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/254a4c63-79d7-55c3-86f3-20c38c90beef.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/a539eda3-a47b-5b08-a2d6-a2bcead0bd58/v4-conditional-luna-1/thumbnails/254a4c63-79d7-55c3-86f3-20c38c90beef.jpg"}, {"id": "5f8ec3f8-01c3-5831-9910-12ab0ade7e69", "sourceSlug": "garden-wise-pt-1-a539eda3", "sourceTitle": "Garden Wise (Pt 1)", "sourceYear": null, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 51.218, "endSeconds": 61.128, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/a539eda3-a47b-5b08-a2d6-a2bcead0bd58/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/5f8ec3f8-01c3-5831-9910-12ab0ade7e69.mp